<title>UK: Smithkline Beecham to launch $200 mln bond.</title>
<headline>Smithkline Beecham to launch $200 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smithkline Beecham will shortly launch a $200 million five-year Eurobond, primary market players said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>A spread in ther mid-20s basis points over U.S. Treasuries was expected. Citibank was said to be the lead manager.</p>
<p>Smithkline Beecham last week launched a 125 million Swiss franc four-year bond via Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p>-- Dan Lalor, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
